  "intro": "Typical room-temperature properties of about 40 metals, plastics, ceramics and electronics materials, filtered and sorted, with one material's key values and an optional side-by-side comparison. Values are typical datasheet values (MatWeb, ASM Handbook, supplier sheets) for the stated temper or condition.",
