  "usage": "Pick a category (all, metal, plastic, electronics, ceramic, composite), an optional text filter, a sort key (name, rho, E, sy, uts, cte, k, spE, spS), a material id for focus and optionally one for compare. It returns the focus material's density (g/cm³), modulus (GPa), yield and tensile strength (MPa), CTE (ppm/K) and conductivity (W/m·K), a comparison table with ratios, and the filtered table. Use it to choose a material or to look up a value for another calculation.",
  "sources": [
    "MatWeb material property data (typical values)",
    "ASM Handbook vol. 2 (non-ferrous) and ASM Metals Handbook desk edition",
    "Supplier datasheets: DuPont Delrin 100, Victrex PEEK 450G, Isola FR-4, CoorsTek 96 % alumina"
  ]
